WEBVTT

00:00:00.590 --> 00:00:01.930
Hang on a minute.

00:00:02.280 --> 00:00:05.400
So if worst comes to worst, you'll kill Iris-san?

00:00:05.980 --> 00:00:08.760
If we can't prevent her 
from becoming a Dragon,

00:00:08.760 --> 00:00:10.820
I'll be the one to deliver the blow.

00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:12.030
You can't!

00:00:14.890 --> 00:00:15.900
It's fine.

00:00:16.640 --> 00:00:18.370
My hands are already...

00:00:36.760 --> 00:00:43.060
<b><i>Unlimited Fafnir</i></b>

00:01:51.590 --> 00:01:55.420
<b>Howling Fafnir</b>

00:01:53.090 --> 00:01:56.000
Leviathan within firing range.

00:01:56.260 --> 00:01:58.470
Not yet. Lure it closer.

00:02:01.520 --> 00:02:02.390
Fire!

00:02:27.630 --> 00:02:29.330
Anti-gravity.

00:02:30.100 --> 00:02:34.380
It's generating a repulsion 
field to distort space itself.

00:02:35.220 --> 00:02:40.520
You could say it's the bearer of a power 
that allows it to repel anything.

00:02:42.220 --> 00:02:44.170
<i>I'm counting on you all.</i>

00:02:45.350 --> 00:02:48.080
Understood, Shinomiya-sensei.

00:02:48.080 --> 00:02:49.840
It's easy.

00:02:50.400 --> 00:02:53.060
Just don't give it a chance to push us away.

00:02:53.060 --> 00:02:55.580
Full frontal attack.

00:03:13.140 --> 00:03:15.790
All units, fire!

00:03:16.140 --> 00:03:18.720
Pierce it! Flare!

00:03:21.910 --> 00:03:23.930
Aero Blast Quartet!

00:03:27.000 --> 00:03:28.220
Mjölnir!

00:03:30.130 --> 00:03:32.690
First arrow: Folk Wind!

00:03:50.210 --> 00:03:52.700
Oh, no! It's angry.

00:03:53.350 --> 00:03:56.800
Everyone, run!

00:04:00.260 --> 00:04:01.880
Deploy barrier!

00:04:21.280 --> 00:04:22.620
Fix the monitor, quick!

00:04:22.620 --> 00:04:23.970
<i>All units, retreat!</i>

00:04:23.170 --> 00:04:24.470
Status report!

00:04:23.970 --> 00:04:25.500
<i>Lowering defense line!</i>

00:04:27.590 --> 00:04:29.030
This isn't the time...

00:04:34.520 --> 00:04:35.460
Mitsuki.

00:04:41.210 --> 00:04:44.220
I only called for you.

00:04:44.220 --> 00:04:47.720
I thought it would be dangerous 
to leave Iris by herself.

00:04:49.840 --> 00:04:53.390
Iris, cover your ears until we're done talking.

00:04:54.550 --> 00:04:56.190
You probably shouldn't hear this.

00:04:59.390 --> 00:05:01.690
NIFL has infiltrated, hasn't it?

00:05:02.420 --> 00:05:06.160
It's only a matter of time 
before they breach Midgardsormr.

00:05:06.160 --> 00:05:09.790
So you're going to leave Iris to die?

00:05:10.300 --> 00:05:13.000
I don't think it's the ideal decision.

00:05:13.220 --> 00:05:17.640
But we can't have a repeat of 
what happened two years ago.

00:05:17.640 --> 00:05:19.310
Are you talking about your sister?

00:05:20.420 --> 00:05:21.740
So you knew.

00:05:22.260 --> 00:05:24.320
That's why you asked NIFL to intervene?

00:05:24.700 --> 00:05:27.580
It was better than burdening the girls.

00:05:28.270 --> 00:05:31.140
Could you please tell me 
their infiltration route?

00:05:32.220 --> 00:05:34.440
Leave the rest to me.

00:05:35.020 --> 00:05:37.780
I'm the one Iris trusted with her life.

00:05:37.780 --> 00:05:39.480
I don't intend to yield that to anyone.

00:05:39.480 --> 00:05:40.780
That's foolish.

00:05:40.780 --> 00:05:42.560
What can you do by yourself?

00:05:43.140 --> 00:05:46.070
If they're human? Anything.

00:05:49.760 --> 00:05:51.060
Let's go, Iris.

00:05:52.150 --> 00:05:52.950
Where to?

00:05:57.690 --> 00:06:00.760
Mononobe Yuu, are you...

00:06:09.200 --> 00:06:12.200
Requesting negotiations.

00:06:17.340 --> 00:06:20.480
Is NIFL coming to kill me?

00:06:22.420 --> 00:06:27.660
I suspect they deployed a special 
squad that answers to my old boss.

00:06:28.160 --> 00:06:30.280
I'll drive them all back.

00:06:31.740 --> 00:06:34.780
Can I stay with you, Mononobe?

00:06:35.250 --> 00:06:37.370
That'd be the safest thing to do.

00:06:37.370 --> 00:06:40.300
So long as you're by me, you won't die.

00:06:46.900 --> 00:06:47.690
Okay.

00:07:02.690 --> 00:07:04.260
There're six of them.

00:07:04.860 --> 00:07:06.260
Stay here, Iris.

00:07:06.260 --> 00:07:06.870
Okay.

00:07:11.020 --> 00:07:12.360
AT Nergal.

00:07:13.370 --> 00:07:14.760
Are you going to kill them?

00:07:14.760 --> 00:07:16.370
I'm just going to knock them out.

00:07:16.370 --> 00:07:19.870
But they have real guns, don't they?

00:07:19.870 --> 00:07:21.980
It'll be fine. Trust me.

00:07:23.280 --> 00:07:24.630
Mononobe...

00:07:47.700 --> 00:07:49.490
It's safe now, Iris.

00:07:53.810 --> 00:07:54.940
Mononobe!

00:07:55.560 --> 00:07:57.040
I heard the gunfire.

00:07:57.040 --> 00:07:58.590
I was scared.

00:07:59.060 --> 00:08:01.880
I thought you might get shot.

00:08:02.430 --> 00:08:04.840
I told you to trust me.

00:08:06.180 --> 00:08:09.600
If you say so, then I know it'll really be okay.

00:08:10.740 --> 00:08:12.280
You monster!

00:08:12.570 --> 00:08:13.360
No!

00:08:23.190 --> 00:08:24.920
Iris, what was that?

00:08:25.170 --> 00:08:28.520
I don't really know. I was in a panic.

00:08:29.280 --> 00:08:31.530
I thought you might die.

00:08:31.530 --> 00:08:33.610
I... I...

00:08:34.060 --> 00:08:38.290
You know, you should be worrying about yourself.

00:08:38.290 --> 00:08:41.080
It's you that Leviathan is after.

00:08:42.090 --> 00:08:43.490
I know.

00:08:43.490 --> 00:08:45.210
Let's go back to the shelter now.

00:08:45.210 --> 00:08:47.300
No, it'd be no use.

00:08:48.430 --> 00:08:50.780
No matter how much we hide underground,

00:08:50.780 --> 00:08:53.560
if it gets close, it'll breach us easily.

00:08:53.560 --> 00:08:55.130
We'd only be delaying the inevitable.

00:08:55.820 --> 00:08:56.980
Instead...

00:09:06.900 --> 00:09:09.850
If it gets past the final defense line,

00:09:09.850 --> 00:09:11.820
we'll fight it ourselves.

00:09:11.820 --> 00:09:13.400
Just us?

00:09:13.400 --> 00:09:15.420
That's impossible.

00:09:15.420 --> 00:09:18.220
No, from what I've seen,

00:09:18.220 --> 00:09:19.920
what's most effective against Leviathan is—

00:09:19.920 --> 00:09:22.040
There are no effective options.

00:09:23.470 --> 00:09:24.720
Mitsuki-chan.

00:09:27.590 --> 00:09:30.640
The enemy is approaching Defense Line Three.

00:09:31.470 --> 00:09:33.210
It's over.

00:09:33.700 --> 00:09:36.600
Nii-san, please hand over Iris-san.

00:09:39.620 --> 00:09:40.850
Mitsuki...

00:09:42.700 --> 00:09:45.040
It's my responsibility.

00:09:45.040 --> 00:09:47.530
My hands are already...

00:09:49.630 --> 00:09:51.480
Is this about Shinomiya Miyako?

00:09:53.820 --> 00:09:55.340
Your classmate.

00:09:56.500 --> 00:10:00.730
I can't even imagine how you must have felt,

00:10:01.190 --> 00:10:02.820
killing your friend who became a Dragon.

00:10:03.450 --> 00:10:05.160
But that doesn't mean Iris—

00:10:05.160 --> 00:10:09.560
I'm not going to let you kill Iris-san. Not you!

00:10:09.560 --> 00:10:13.220
My hands are already dirtied 
from two years ago.

00:10:13.890 --> 00:10:18.090
I'm not letting you kill Iris, 
either, Mitsuki. Not you.

00:10:21.560 --> 00:10:24.340
Mononobe... Mitsuki-chan...

00:10:27.990 --> 00:10:29.670
Don't fight!

00:10:29.670 --> 00:10:31.780
It's not the time to be fighting.

00:10:31.780 --> 00:10:33.650
No, it's the right time.

00:10:34.380 --> 00:10:37.610
Words won't get through to 
this stubborn sister of mine.

00:10:37.860 --> 00:10:42.290
This is the only way to make 
my obstinate brother listen.

00:10:54.050 --> 00:10:54.920
I can see your panties.

00:11:04.920 --> 00:11:08.220
The first one to touch the 
other person's head wins.

00:11:08.660 --> 00:11:10.960
That's the rule we made for when we fight.

00:11:11.620 --> 00:11:13.490
Break that rule and we're 
through with each other.

00:11:13.490 --> 00:11:14.690
You remember, don't you?

00:11:15.850 --> 00:11:16.610
Yes.

00:11:17.910 --> 00:11:19.180
Mitsuki-chan.

00:11:20.110 --> 00:11:24.450
There's no point in fighting 
over who's going to kill Iris.

00:11:25.010 --> 00:11:28.920
Why don't we focus on making 
our last stand instead?

00:11:29.330 --> 00:11:31.580
Our last stand?

00:11:40.880 --> 00:11:43.600
What are you all doing here?

00:11:43.600 --> 00:11:47.100
I'm sorry, Lisa-chan.

00:11:47.100 --> 00:11:48.680
You don't have to apologize.

00:11:48.940 --> 00:11:52.250
Your life depends on this battle.

00:11:52.780 --> 00:11:54.690
You have the right to 
commit everything to it.

00:11:54.690 --> 00:11:56.770
But, Mononobe Yuu...

00:11:56.770 --> 00:12:00.710
Iris's attacks are the most 
effective against Leviathan.

00:12:02.610 --> 00:12:04.840
Mine?

00:12:05.060 --> 00:12:09.800
But no matter what she generates, 
she makes it explode.

00:12:09.800 --> 00:12:10.820
Yeah.

00:12:10.820 --> 00:12:11.720
That's the thing.

00:12:12.740 --> 00:12:17.520
From what I've seen, Iris's spatial 
comprehension abilities are by no means bad.

00:12:17.940 --> 00:12:21.400
If she can generate explosives 
right by the target,

00:12:21.400 --> 00:12:23.820
she can cause certain damage.

00:12:24.520 --> 00:12:28.450
But I don't know if I can do it right.

00:12:28.450 --> 00:12:30.220
You did just now.

00:12:30.780 --> 00:12:31.690
But...

00:12:33.450 --> 00:12:34.560
It's here.

00:12:34.980 --> 00:12:38.340
<i>Leviathan approaching Defense Line Three.</i>

00:12:51.900 --> 00:12:53.850
It's calling me.

00:12:54.660 --> 00:12:57.080
It's saying it wants me.

00:12:57.580 --> 00:12:59.540
It's not too late.

00:12:59.980 --> 00:13:02.320
Hurry up and take Iris-san 
to the underground shelter.

00:13:02.650 --> 00:13:03.570
What'll you do?

00:13:05.180 --> 00:13:07.300
Are you going to let it 
have its way with you?

00:13:09.220 --> 00:13:10.430
I...

00:13:12.360 --> 00:13:13.610
I...

00:13:23.220 --> 00:13:24.520
Caduceus!

00:13:35.900 --> 00:13:37.650
Can you aim at it from here?

00:13:37.650 --> 00:13:39.280
It's far, but I'll try.

00:13:39.580 --> 00:13:42.840
I'm going to hit it with 
everything I can generate!

00:13:45.480 --> 00:13:49.920
Come, come, fragment from afar.

00:13:53.180 --> 00:13:54.400
Stay away!

00:13:54.760 --> 00:13:58.240
I hate you!

00:13:58.550 --> 00:14:01.200
Seigin, burst!

00:14:09.500 --> 00:14:11.000
Was that <i>our</i> Iris-san?

00:14:11.270 --> 00:14:12.180
Mitsuki.

00:14:13.030 --> 00:14:14.480
Resume the assault!

00:14:14.890 --> 00:14:17.250
All units to positions!

00:14:20.250 --> 00:14:22.880
Seigin, burst!

00:14:22.880 --> 00:14:23.850
Burst!

00:14:24.470 --> 00:14:26.920
Burst!

00:14:32.480 --> 00:14:36.320
Now! Aim for the rupture 
in the repulsion field!

00:14:36.700 --> 00:14:39.560
Pierce it! Flare!

00:14:43.180 --> 00:14:45.000
It's working.

00:14:45.350 --> 00:14:47.480
Aero Blast Quartet!

00:14:48.930 --> 00:14:50.160
Mjölnir!

00:14:55.000 --> 00:14:57.480
First arrow: Folk Wind!

00:15:01.270 --> 00:15:03.900
Seigin, burst!

00:15:22.290 --> 00:15:25.110
It's breached Defense Line Three!

00:15:26.780 --> 00:15:30.450
Is it going to happen again?

00:15:42.880 --> 00:15:45.710
Seigin, burst!

00:15:55.920 --> 00:15:57.310
I'm not giving up.

00:15:57.830 --> 00:16:01.360
Not against the thing that 
took away everyone I loved!

00:16:01.360 --> 00:16:03.860
I'm not letting it have me, too!

00:16:03.860 --> 00:16:05.320
I can't let it!

00:16:07.170 --> 00:16:08.970
Stay away!

00:16:17.130 --> 00:16:20.410
You don't give up, do you, Mitsuki?

00:16:21.240 --> 00:16:23.430
My house is there.

00:16:24.070 --> 00:16:29.410
That city is where my family can belong.

00:16:29.410 --> 00:16:31.020
<i>I wanted strength.</i>

00:16:33.480 --> 00:16:38.470
Request: confirmed. 
Omniscience circuits: partially released.

00:16:38.470 --> 00:16:41.630
Analysis: common interests.

00:16:40.790 --> 00:16:42.070
Who's there?!

00:16:41.630 --> 00:16:46.300
Proposal: I am the oldest of Gaia's Dragonkind.

00:16:46.300 --> 00:16:53.970
Known to the Tule and Acht 
as Kiskanu or Yggdrasil.

00:16:53.970 --> 00:16:55.360
Yggdrasil?

00:16:55.760 --> 00:16:57.620
It can't be... The Green?

00:16:58.380 --> 00:16:59.520
Are you real?

00:17:00.100 --> 00:17:02.760
A Dragon speaking to a human?

00:17:01.280 --> 00:17:08.060
Reconfirm: requesting trade negotiations.

00:17:08.060 --> 00:17:10.150
What could you possibly give me?

00:17:10.150 --> 00:17:12.160
What am I supposed to give you?

00:17:12.160 --> 00:17:15.460
Offering: strength.

00:17:15.460 --> 00:17:18.360
Seeking: destruction.

00:17:18.360 --> 00:17:22.210
Compensation: your memories.

00:17:26.250 --> 00:17:28.480
Stay away!

00:17:42.780 --> 00:17:45.200
Please don't stop me now.

00:17:46.640 --> 00:17:50.380
No matter what happens, I'm your brother.

00:17:52.450 --> 00:17:54.950
Can you lend me your strength?

00:17:55.540 --> 00:17:57.730
You're not killing me yet?

00:17:58.500 --> 00:18:01.520
Leave the rest to me.

00:18:06.820 --> 00:18:08.610
I want strength.

00:18:08.610 --> 00:18:11.180
I accept your offer.

00:18:11.620 --> 00:18:13.940
Connection: accepted.

00:18:14.320 --> 00:18:17.320
Here's the rest of our trade, Yggdrasil!

00:18:17.320 --> 00:18:20.680
Reconnection: accepted.

00:18:28.280 --> 00:18:30.890
Seeking: destruction.

00:18:31.370 --> 00:18:33.560
Of all other Dragonkind.

00:18:34.890 --> 00:18:38.840
I need more strength than last time.

00:18:38.840 --> 00:18:41.600
Offering: strength.

00:18:42.020 --> 00:18:45.770
Compensation: your memories.

00:18:54.860 --> 00:18:57.600
Terminate connection!

00:18:59.220 --> 00:19:03.380
Marduke primary armament, Babel!

00:19:17.380 --> 00:19:18.310
Fire!

00:19:27.780 --> 00:19:29.040
Final arrow:

00:19:30.900 --> 00:19:34.500
Last Quark!

00:19:42.040 --> 00:19:43.360
We won?

00:19:51.320 --> 00:19:52.860
Did we do it?

00:19:59.630 --> 00:20:02.200
It's back to normal, Mononobe!

00:20:06.740 --> 00:20:07.990
Mononobe?

00:20:14.800 --> 00:20:17.740
<i>Good work, Lieutenant Mononobe.</i>

00:20:18.260 --> 00:20:21.020
<i>I'm glad I trusted you.</i>

00:20:21.020 --> 00:20:23.820
<i>I didn't expect such a performance.</i>

00:20:25.330 --> 00:20:30.780
<i>I'm looking forward to working 
with you in the future, my Fafnir.</i>

00:20:38.830 --> 00:20:41.100
It's almost curfew time.

00:20:41.100 --> 00:20:44.350
And are you okay?

00:20:44.350 --> 00:20:46.050
I'll be back soon.

00:20:46.050 --> 00:20:47.880
My body's fine, too, see?

00:20:49.020 --> 00:20:50.360
Sorry to worry you.

00:20:51.880 --> 00:20:53.270
I'm a bad brother.

00:20:53.630 --> 00:20:54.300
Huh?

00:21:02.720 --> 00:21:03.700
Iris.

00:21:04.080 --> 00:21:06.700
Mononobe, are you okay now?

00:21:07.040 --> 00:21:09.400
I just passed out a little.

00:21:09.400 --> 00:21:11.230
So what did you need?

00:21:12.840 --> 00:21:17.020
I wanted to ask something I didn't 
get to finish asking you before.

00:21:17.470 --> 00:21:18.660
Before?

00:21:19.800 --> 00:21:24.550
Can I be your friend?

00:21:25.980 --> 00:21:27.470
We're friends already, aren't we?

00:21:27.470 --> 00:21:31.460
Really? Since when have I been your friend?

00:21:31.460 --> 00:21:33.190
When? Well...

00:21:34.100 --> 00:21:36.720
I thought we'd been friends for a while now.

00:21:36.980 --> 00:21:42.530
You always give me what I want most, Mononobe.

00:21:43.840 --> 00:21:45.700
So I want to...

00:21:46.360 --> 00:21:50.220
So... Let me thank you.

00:21:55.150 --> 00:21:57.610
Thanks, Mononobe.

00:23:39.890 --> 00:24:09.750
<b>Next Episode</b>

00:23:40.720 --> 00:23:41.560
Yay!

00:23:41.560 --> 00:23:44.230
We defeated the Leviathan!

00:23:44.510 --> 00:23:47.440
And I'm friends with Mononobe now.

00:23:47.760 --> 00:23:50.490
I'm so happy.

00:23:50.490 --> 00:23:53.010
That's why I gave Mononobe my first...

00:23:54.030 --> 00:23:55.070
What?

00:23:55.070 --> 00:23:56.370
A new friend?

00:23:56.850 --> 00:23:59.240
What? Mononobe's wife?

00:23:59.240 --> 00:24:01.790
What? Taking a bath together?!

00:24:01.790 --> 00:24:04.460
Next time on <i>Unlimited Fafnir</i>:

00:24:04.460 --> 00:24:05.880
"Tear the Dragonkind."

00:24:06.430 --> 00:24:09.760
Mononobe's always with Tear-chan. No fair.

00:24:09.760 --> 00:24:19.940
<b>Illustration: Coffee Kizoku</b>
